 'content_safety': False, 'iab_categories': True, 'content_safety_labels': {'status': 'unavailable', 'results': [], 'summary': {}}, 'iab_categories_result': {'status': 'success', 'results': [{'text': "You. Hello and welcome. This is active guest room 52.1. On August 10, 2023, we have Ahmed Elsaid, Alexander Arorbia and Travis Desel. Ahmed is going to give a presentation and following we will have some reflections and discussions. So thank you all for joining and Ahmed to you for the presentation. Okay, thanks so much for having me. Today I'm going to discuss the methods that we came up to solve new art, texture, search and neuralvolution problems.", 'labels': [{'relevance': 0.9351708889007568, 'label': 'FineArt>DigitalArts'}, {'relevance': 0.595487654209137, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Computing>ComputerSoftwareAndApplications>3-DGraphics'}, {'relevance': 0.4951956868171692, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Computing>ComputerSoftwareAndApplications>GraphicsSoftware'}, {'relevance': 0.18579132854938507, 'label': 'Hobbies&Interests>ArtsAndCrafts>DrawingAndSketching'}, {'relevance': 0.0949375182390213, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Computing>ComputerSoftwareAndApplications>ComputerAnimation'}, {'relevance': 0.09068706631660461, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Computing>ComputerSoftwareAndApplications>PhotoEditingSoftware'}, {'relevance': 0.04107257351279259, 'label': 'FineArt>Design'}, {'relevance': 0.020160550251603127, 'label': 'BooksAndLiterature>ArtAndPhotographyBooks'}, {'relevance': 0.008700993843376637, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>AugmentedReality'}, {'relevance': 0.0086249690502882, 'label': 'FineArt'}], 'timestamp': {'start': 170, 'end': 45180}, 'sentences_idx_start': 0, 'sentences_idx_end': 7}, {'text': "The methods that are ant colony optimization based solutions. So as the title here is mentioning, ant colony optimization for neural text research and neurovolution. This work is collaboration between me, my previous advisor, Dr. Travis Desel, and my co advisor Dr. Alexander Auroravian. I'm currently an assistant professor in University of North Carolina, wilmington. And moving on to the next slide.", 'labels': [{'relevance': 0.4992145597934723, 'label': 'Hobbies&Interests>Beekeeping'}, {'relevance': 0.009013359434902668, 'label': 'Pets>Birds'}, {'relevance': 0.005173990502953529, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>ArtificialIntelligence'}, {'relevance': 0.0032257591374218464, 'label': 'Pets>Cats'}, {'relevance': 0.001973899081349373, 'label': 'MedicalHealth>DiseasesAndConditions>Allergies'}, {'relevance': 0.0017606733599677682, 'label': 'BusinessAndFinance>Industries>BiotechAndBiomedicalIndustry'}, {'relevance': 0.0013156816130504012, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Robotics'}, {'relevance': 0.0013103572418913245, 'label': 'Education>LanguageLearning'}, {'relevance': 0.001283825607970357, 'label': 'BusinessAndFinance>Industries>AviationIndustry'}, {'relevance': 0.0010879982728511095, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Computing>ProgrammingLanguages'}], 'timestamp': {'start': 46110, 'end': 89110}, 'sentences_idx_start': 8, 'sentences_idx_end': 14}, {'text': "So as an overview, the things that I'm going to discuss today, I'll try to give Bird Eyes view for what is neurovolution, why we what, why we need it. And from there, I'll just try to discuss our methods that is based on end calling optimization which is called N based neurotropology search or ants for short.", 'labels': [{'relevance': 0.31506767868995667, 'label': 'Hobbies&Interests>Beekeeping'}, {'relevance': 0.15529818832874298, 'label': 'Pets>Birds'}, {'relevance': 0.005375269800424576, 'label': 'Science>BiologicalSciences'}, {'relevance': 0.0049674250185489655, 'label': 'Pets>Reptiles'}, {'relevance': 0.003387781325727701, 'label': 'Hobbies&Interests>Birdwatching'}, {'relevance': 0.0008719192119315267, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Robotics'}, {'relevance': 0.0006384778534993529, 'label': 'Science>Genetics'}, {'relevance': 0.000541346613317728, 'label': 'Pets>FishA