 'timestamp': {'start': 710090, 'end': 735734}, 'sentences_idx_start': 62, 'sentences_idx_end': 63}, {'text': 'They will deposit some morpher mole on the same path, making it more appealing to other ants to take it, so that they can bring more food to the nest. So this process shows us the exploitation behavior of ants. But again, from time to time, ants also try to exploit some other food resources, potential food resources, and they kind of resist following the hormone traces, and they try to go away and find some new food resources for the nest.', 'labels': [{'relevance': 0.9208762645721436, 'label': 'Hobbies&Interests>Beekeeping'}, {'relevance': 0.0014276140136644244, 'label': 'Pets>Birds'}, {'relevance': 0.0014207866042852402, 'label': 'Pets>FishAndAquariums'}, {'relevance': 0.0005872697220183909, 'label': 'Pets>Reptiles'}, {'relevance': 0.0005394722102209926, 'label': 'Pets>LargeAnimals'}, {'relevance': 0.00044122597319073975, 'label': 'MedicalHealth>DiseasesAndConditions>Allergies'}, {'relevance': 0.0002938473189715296, 'label': 'Science>BiologicalSciences'}, {'relevance': 0.00028859596932306886, 'label': 'BusinessAndFinance>Industries>FoodIndustry'}, {'relevance': 0.0002583515306469053, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Computing>Internet>CloudComputing'}, {'relevance': 0.00023165838501881808, 'label': 'EventsAndAttractions>PersonalCelebrations&LifeEvents>Birth'}], 'timestamp': {'start': 735772, 'end': 773490}, 'sentences_idx_start': 64, 'sentences_idx_end': 66}, {'text': "So the ants are not only exploiters, they're also explorers and these two concepts were used by Marco Derago to kind of like balance the search for the better or faster path between the cities for the travel sales management problem. The third thing that we observed also in how I spoke in nature is that the older substance, the pheromone, also evaporates.", 'labels': [{'relevance': 0.06633825600147247, 'label': 'Hobbies&Interests>Beekeeping'}, {'relevance': 0.023511536419391632, 'label': 'Tra