s to finish the experiments. The results that we got showed that of course outperformed the unoptimized structures and it also outperformed Neat and then some of the combinations of ends outperformed Exam.', 'labels': [{'relevance': 0.0313725546002388, 'label': 'Hobbies&Interests>Beekeeping'}, {'relevance': 0.013868036679923534, 'label': 'BusinessAndFinance>Industries>BiotechAndBiomedicalIndustry'}, {'relevance': 0.007299857214093208, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>ArtificialIntelligence'}, {'relevance': 0.005654581356793642, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Robotics'}, {'relevance': 0.004470927640795708, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Computing>ProgrammingLanguages'}, {'relevance': 0.0028177222702652216, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Computing'}, {'relevance': 0.0010198584059253335, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Computing>ComputerSoftwareAndApplications>OperatingSystems'}, {'relevance': 0.0007384359487332404, 'label': 'Pets>Birds'}, {'relevance': 0.0004105200641788542, 'label': 'Science>Genetics'}, {'relevance': 0.0003869689244311303, 'label': 'Pets>VeterinaryMedicine'}], 'timestamp': {'start': 2135770, 'end': 2192858}, 'sentences_idx_start': 190, 'sentences_idx_end': 195}, {'text': 'So Exam here is the fourth from the left and we can see that the mean absolute error for some of the versions or the combinations of ant heuristics outperformed Exam. So we tried to look to do some statistical study for the results we got from Ads. So we tried to look at the top performing neural networks coming in our results. So we tried to look at the top ten, 2522 hundred and 55 hundred results and we look at the contribution of these heuristics in these best performing neural networks or structures.', 'labels': [{'relevance': 0.2533932328224182, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>ArtificialIntelligence'}, {'relevance': 0.018852325156331062, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Computing>Internet>Search'}, {'relevance': 0.006870834622532129, 'label': 'BusinessAndFinance>Business>MarketingAnd