arch space for Kents is not purely continuous because the time lags are represented by discrete layers. We want to replace this with the continuous dimension continuous layer representing the time lag in RNNs. However, this is a little bit challenging because the time lags has to be known prior to any optimization process because other than that we will be mapping the whole time series as time lags and then picking the time lags from them which is not feasible.', 'labels': [{'relevance': 0.11073035001754761, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Computing>Internet>Search'}, {'relevance': 0.006717164069414139, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Computing>ComputerSoftwareAndApplications>Databases'}, {'relevance': 0.0023975723888725042, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Computing>DataStorageAndWarehousing'}, {'relevance': 0.00039782209205441177, 'label': 'MedicalHealth>MedicalTests'}, {'relevance': 0.00018690191791392863, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Computing>Internet>CloudComputing'}, {'relevance': 0.0001075883410521783, 'label': 'Hobbies&Interests>GenealogyAndAncestry'}, {'relevance': 0.00010244236909784377, 'label': 'Science'}, {'relevance': 7.64772848924622e-05, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Computing>ComputerSoftwareAndApplications>3-DGraphics'}, {'relevance': 7.356467540375888e-05, 'label': 'Shopping>SalesAndPromotions'}, {'relevance': 6.047646820661612e-05, 'label': 'BusinessAndFinance>Business>MarketingAndAdvertising'}], 'timestamp': {'start': 3403292, 'end': 3453282}, 'sentences_idx_start': 292, 'sentences_idx_end': 294}, {'text': "So this is the first point we're considering to investigate for in future work. The second one is to investigate this finding that we found in the results in ants where the recurrent connections disappeared from the best performing structures. The theory that we have is that the memory based cells replace these connections, give us the information that we need from the pastime steps so that they were more effective, more efficient in doing th