 to form a structure, neural network structure. And we take that structure and train it and test it and then compare its performance to a population of best performing neural networks, best performance structures. And if it's better than the worst in the population, then we reward the path that the ants took, the agents took over in the superstructure, reward with hormone so that it makes these paths appealing for later iterations through the evolution process or the optimization process.", 'start': 1037550, 'end': 1109360, 'confidence': 1.0, 'words': [{'text': 'And', 'start': 1037550, 'end': 1038298, 'confidence': 1.0, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'then', 'start': 1038464, 'end': 1038890, 'confidence': 0.99669, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'we', 'start': 1038960, 'end': 1039580, 'confidence': 0.99585, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'let', 'start': 1039950, 'end': 1040458, 'confidence': 0.69817, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'a', 'start': 1040544, 'end': 1040794, 'confidence': 0.68, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'number', 'start': 1040832, 'end': 1041034, 'confidence': 1.0, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'of', 'start': 1041072, 'end': 1041226, 'confidence': 1.0, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'agents', 'start': 1041248, 'end': 1041866, 'confidence': 0.62424, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'swarm', 'start': 1042048, 'end': 1042646, 'confidence': 0.99977, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'over', 'start': 1042678, 'end': 1042922, 'confidence': 0.66085, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'the', 'start': 1042976, 'end': 1043194, 'confidence': 0.7, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'structure', 'start': 1043232, 'end': 1044090, 'confidence': 0.46101, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'from', 'start': 1045070, 'end': 1045434, 'confidence': 0.99999, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'an', 'start': 1045472, 'end': 1045626, 'confidence': 0.99999, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'input', 'start': 1045648, 'end': 1045974, 'confidence': 0.69878, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'text': 'node', 'start': 1046022, 'end': 1046566, 'confidence': 0.97807, 'speaker': 'A'}, {'tex